   title="Frequently Asked Questions"
   items=[
     {"question": "What's the difference between withMinRole and withFeaturePermission?", "answer": "withMinRole checks role hierarchy (admin can do what member can). withFeaturePermission checks specific permissions on resources (project:delete). Use withMinRole for broad access, withFeaturePermission for granular control."},
     {"question": "Can I use multiple middleware?", "answer": "Yes. Chain them with .use(): authenticatedActionClient.use(middleware1).use(middleware2). They run in order, and each can enrich ctx."},
     {"question": "How do I create organization-scoped actions?", "answer": "Use organizationActionClient or add withFeaturePermission to authenticatedActionClient. Both inject ctx.organizationId and verify membership."},
